WEBVTT

NOTE
Balamb Garden becomes mobile — the academy's machinery powers up.
Duration: approximately 15 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
A green-lit control mechanism arcs with blue electricity.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:11.420
An ornate banner-hung deck; a white ring of energy blazes across the floor.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.600
Balamb Garden converts to mobile form.
